config BR2_PACKAGE_ISO_CODES
	bool "iso-codes"
	help
	  ISO 639, ISO 3166, ISO 4217, ISO 15924 and ISO 639-3
	  language/country/currency/script lists, with gettext
	  translations.  Required at runtime by gnome-desktop and
	  many GNOME applications.

	  https://salsa.debian.org/iso-codes-team/iso-codes
